{% set intro_content %}
<h2>We're down the road</h2>
<p>Our workshop is on Progress Way. If you're in Squamish, your sauna gets built and delivered without ever leaving town. No freight company, no crating, no mystery about what shows up.</p>
<p>We've done residential builds in Brackendale and Valleycliffe, commercial units for the Brackendale Art Gallery, and work for the Squamish Fire Department. The climate here is specific and we don't have to guess about it. Rain, temperature swings, moisture that finds every gap in untreated wood. We build for it because we live in it.</p>
<p>If you want to see the shop or look at a finished unit before committing, you're welcome to come by. It's easier to talk about a sauna when you're standing next to one.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set local_content %}
<h2>Builds we've done here</h2>
<p>The Brackendale Art Gallery runs one of our SC commercial units. We've delivered residential S4 and S6 builds in Brackendale proper. The Squamish Fire Department has had units from us (long story, they left and came back). Most of our build portfolio started within a few kilometers of the shop.</p>
<p>If you're in the area and want to talk about a build, <a href="/contact/" class="link--accent-underline">get in touch</a>. We'll probably suggest you come see the workshop first.</p>
{% endset %}

